Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "nome": "Dólar",
  "cor": "#fbbf24"
}

### Listar Categorias do Portfólio
GET {{baseUrl}}/portfolios/{{idPortfolio}}/categorias-ativos
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

